 P if P, Q, QP != NULL\0A *                 - \5Cc MBEDTLS_ERR_RSA_KEY_CHECK_FAILED if check failed,\0A *                   potentially including \5Cc MBEDTLS_ERR_MPI_XXX if some\0A *                   MPI calculations failed.\0A *                 - \5Cc MBEDTLS_ERR_RSA_BAD_INPUT_DATA if insufficient\0A *                   data was provided to check DP, DQ or QP.\0A *\0A * \5Cnote           The function can be used with a restricted set of arguments\0A *                 to perform specific checks only. E.g., calling it with the\0A *                 parameters (P, -, D, DP, -, -) will check DP = D mod P-1.\0A */\0Aint mbedtls_rsa_validate_crt(const mbedtls_mpi *P,  const mbedtls_mpi *Q,\0A                             const mbedtls_mpi *D,  const mbedtls_mpi *DP,\0A                             const mbedtls_mpi *DQ, const mbedtls_mpi *QP);\0A\0A#ifdef __cplusplus\0A}\0A#endif\0A\0A#endif /* rsa_alt_helpers.h */\0A\00" }
